WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.616 --> 00:00:13.980
"Help!" cried Bajie.

2
00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:18.321
Spiderwebs now covered the pig so he couldn't move at all.

3
00:00:19.741 --> 00:00:21.562
Wukong quickly grew tall.

4
00:00:22.602 --> 00:00:25.703
He swung his iron bar furiously at the young women.

5
00:00:25.723 --> 00:00:27.724
"Oh no!"

6
00:00:28.044 --> 00:00:28.864
cried one woman.

7
00:00:30.028 --> 00:00:32.070
"The monkey is a powerful spirit!"

8
00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:33.031
cried another.

9
00:00:33.051 --> 00:00:34.552
"We must leave!"

10
00:00:34.832 --> 00:00:35.553
cried the third.

11
00:00:37.414 --> 00:00:38.395
The women vanished.

12
00:00:38.976 --> 00:00:40.437
Wukong ran into the house.

13
00:00:41.478 --> 00:00:44.781
He saw a large form wrapped in spiderwebs in a corner.

14
00:00:46.962 --> 00:00:47.703
cried the monkey.

15
00:00:48.984 --> 00:00:50.485
He quickly pulled off the webs.

16
00:00:50.545 --> 00:00:55.149
"Thank you, Wukong," said the monk breathlessly.

17
00:00:55.169 --> 00:00:57.932
"Those women were planning to eat me!"

18
00:00:59.292 --> 00:01:01.374
women are gone now," said Wukong.

19
00:01:01.855 --> 00:01:02.615
Then he smirked.

20
00:01:04.817 --> 00:01:05.718
scared them away.

21
00:01:06.339 --> 00:01:07.880
The pig was a real hero!"

22
00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:14.005
said the Tang Monk as they went outside.

23
00:01:14.025 --> 00:01:16.187
"Where is Bajie now?"

24
00:01:17.448 --> 00:01:17.928
right there."

25
00:01:18.109 --> 00:01:21.371
Wukong pointed and laughed.

26
00:01:21.892 --> 00:01:24.554
"Bajie, the brave hero!"

27
00:01:26.908 --> 00:01:30.650
Bajie was on the ground, still struggling to get out of the webs.

28
00:01:32.251 --> 00:01:33.631
pretended to laugh.

29
00:01:33.651 --> 00:01:36.012
"Ha-ha, Wukong.

30
00:01:36.473 --> 00:01:37.393
Very funny."

31
00:01:39.954 --> 00:01:42.675
The road left the forest and headed up a mountain.

32
00:01:44.516 --> 00:01:46.957
The travelers arrived at a Daoist abbey.

33
00:01:46.977 --> 00:01:50.439
"Maybe we can rest here," said Wujing.

34
00:01:51.459 --> 00:01:52.520
group entered the abbey.

35
00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:57.382
An old priest was inside, mixing a potion.

36
00:02:00.625 --> 00:02:01.325
said the priest.

37
00:02:01.345 --> 00:02:03.587
"Come in, and make yourselves at home."

38
00:02:04.908 --> 00:02:06.389
"Thank you," said the Tang Monk.

39
00:02:08.751 --> 00:02:10.972
The priest led them to a sitting area.

40
00:02:16.396 --> 00:02:19.319
Buddhists," the priest observed as everyone sat down.

41
00:02:19.339 --> 00:02:20.860
"Where are you going?"

42
00:02:22.060 --> 00:02:26.362
The Tang Monk opened his mouth to answer, but Wukong spoke first.

43
00:02:26.382 --> 00:02:29.584
"We're on our way to visit friends," said the monkey.

44
00:02:31.145 --> 00:02:32.566
nice," said the priest.

45
00:02:32.586 --> 00:02:35.087
"Would you like some tea?

46
00:02:35.987 --> 00:02:37.108
have plenty of food too.

47
00:02:38.109 --> 00:02:39.469
I will prepare a meal for us."

48
00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:43.171
"That would be wonderful," said Bajie.

49
00:02:44.132 --> 00:02:46.053
The priest stood up and left the room.

50
00:02:46.073 --> 00:02:50.295
"Wukong, why did you lie to the priest?"

51
00:02:50.675 --> 00:02:51.636
asked the Tang Monk.

52
00:02:52.508 --> 00:02:55.010
"I'm just being careful," said the monkey.

53
00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:58.633
"We shouldn't tell everyone we meet that you're the Tang Monk."

54
00:02:59.733 --> 00:03:00.634
Wujing nodded.

55
00:03:01.475 --> 00:03:02.335
is right, Master.

56
00:03:03.216 --> 00:03:05.317
You almost got eaten just this morning."

57
00:03:06.458 --> 00:03:09.200
The priest was in the kitchen, boiling water for tea.

58
00:03:10.261 --> 00:03:13.984
He was looking for rice when he realized he wasn't alone.

59
00:03:15.205 --> 00:03:19.608
The three young women stood nearby, and they looked angry.

60
00:03:20.940 --> 00:03:22.722
my dear friends," said the priest.

61
00:03:22.742 --> 00:03:24.163
"What's wrong?

62
00:03:24.483 --> 00:03:25.204
You look upset."

63
00:03:26.325 --> 00:03:29.327
"We caught the Tang Monk this morning," said one woman.

64
00:03:29.347 --> 00:03:33.250
"But we had to flee our house," said another woman.

65
00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:36.733
"A monkey and a pig attacked us," said the third.

66
00:03:36.753 --> 00:03:40.856
"I have visitors right now," the priest whispered.

67
00:03:40.876 --> 00:03:43.278
"There's a monk with three companions.

68
00:03:44.219 --> 00:03:45.961
One is a monkey and another is a pig!"

69
00:03:47.242 --> 00:03:48.463
"Are you serious?"

70
00:03:48.743 --> 00:03:49.804
whispered the first woman.

71
00:03:50.672 --> 00:03:53.373
"It must be them," whispered the second woman.

72
00:03:53.393 --> 00:03:55.434
"They must not leave!"

73
00:03:55.695 --> 00:03:56.575
whispered the third.

74
00:03:57.375 --> 00:04:00.857
An evil smile flashed across the priest's face.

75
00:04:00.877 --> 00:04:05.379
"We'll eat the Tang Monk, and we'll all live forever!"

76
00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.461
The first woman now looked worried.

77
00:04:09.481 --> 00:04:11.542
how will we defeat the monk's companions?

78
00:04:12.603 --> 00:04:18.280
That monkey is powerful."

79
00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:21.442
The priest went to a cabinet and pulled out a small bottle.

80
00:04:21.463 --> 00:04:24.225
"I'll add this poison to their tea."

81
00:04:27.467 --> 00:04:29.228
The priest returned to the travelers.

82
00:04:33.632 --> 00:04:35.573
I took so long," he said, smiling.

83
00:04:39.476 --> 00:04:40.597
meal will be ready soon.

84
00:04:41.317 --> 00:04:41.958
Here's your tea."

85
00:04:43.299 --> 00:04:44.880
"Thank you," said the Tang Monk.

86
00:04:45.772 --> 00:04:49.034
Wukong looked at the priest and suddenly felt suspicious.

87
00:04:50.175 --> 00:04:52.997
There was something evil behind the man's smile.

88
00:04:54.758 --> 00:04:56.379
monkey glanced at his tea.

89
00:04:57.239 --> 00:04:58.800
It didn't look quite right.

90
00:05:00.522 --> 00:05:02.123
"Master!" cried the monkey.

91
00:05:02.143 --> 00:05:05.024
"Don't drink the—" But it was too late.

92
00:05:06.105 --> 00:05:10.248
The monk, Wujing, and Bajie were already sipping their tea.
